+
+Request: review how `applyPatch` checks and applies patches and make it conform to RFC 6902, errors included.
+
+Done: `replace` now overwrites the member in place (it used to remove and re-add, moving the member to
+the end of the object); `move` with `from` equal to `path` is a no-op (it used to reorder the member).
+Other checks reviewed (pointer syntax, array index rules, `-`, test equality, move into own child,
+missing `value`/`from`, atomicity) already conform. Test added in `src/index.test.ts`.
